    "q": "Key points: <b>Numbers</b>",
    "a": "• <i>Z</i> = protons. <i>A</i> = protons + neutrons.<br>• Neutrons <i>= A - Z</i>. Electrons in an ion <i>= Z - charge</i>.<br>• Ions: only the <b>electrons</b> change."
