    "a": "<b>E) 33</b><br><br>The full configuration is [Ar]3d<sup>10</sup>4s<sup>2</sup>4p<sup>3</sup>. Count: <i>18 + 10 + 2 + 3 = 33</i>. The element is arsenic (group 15, period 4)."
