    "id": "chem12-022",
    "t": "recall",
    "q": "<small>Solutions in the body</small><br><b>Hypotonic (pure water)</b><br><i>Compared with a red blood cell · Effect on the cell?</i>",
    "a": "<b>Compared with a red blood cell:</b> Lower<br><b>Effect on the cell:</b> Water enters: the cell swells and may burst"
