    "t": "key idea",
    "q": "<small>Catalysts</small><br><b>Heterogeneous catalyst</b>",
    "a": "in a different phase from the reactants. Iron in the Haber process, platinum and rhodium in a car's catalytic converter, nickel in hardening vegetable oil."
