    "q": "<small>What oxidation and reduction mean</small><br><b>MnO<sub>4</sub><sup>-</sup> (purple), Cr<sub>2</sub>O<sub>7</sub><sup>2-</sup> (orange)</b><br><i>Reducing agents?</i>",
